          "outputText": "1	# Project Overview
2	
3	Gugu is a local-first, cross-platform Electron app for running multiple AI coding
4	agents in parallel. Each task is isolated in its own Git worktree and can run locally
5	or over SSH, while the desktop app coordinates provider CLIs, ACP chat sessions,
6	terminal sessions, issue and PR integrations, diff review, and release packaging.
7	
8	## Repository Structure
9	
10	This is a pnpm workspace monorepo. The Electron app lives in
11	\`apps/desktop/\` as \`@gugu/desktop\`; shared packages live under
12	\`packages/\`. Unless a path is prefixed with \`packages/\` or another app, app paths
13	such as \`src/...\`, \`drizzle/\`, \`scripts/\`, and \`build/\` are relative to
14	\`apps/desktop/\`.
15	
16	Repo root:
17	
18	- \`.claude/\` - Local Claude agent settings for this checkout.
19	- \`.github/\` - GitHub issue templates, reusable actions, CI, and release workflows.
20	- \`agents/\` - Agent-facing architecture, workflow, convention, integration, and risk docs.
21	- \`apps/desktop/\` - The Electron desktop app.
22	- \`packages/chat-ui/\` - Shared transcript and ACP chat renderer with Storybook coverage.
23	- \`packages/core/\` - Transport-agnostic runtime primitives, including ACP session logic.
24	- \`packages/plugins/\` - Agent provider plugin definitions, hooks, and ACP adapters.
25	- \`packages/shared/\` - Shared primitives such as result types, logging, and markdown helpers.
26	- \`packages/ui/\` - Shared React UI components, theme tokens, recipes, and primitives.
27	- \`pnpm-workspace.yaml\` - Workspace package globs for \`apps/*\` and \`packages/**\`.
28	- Root config files - \`package.json\`, \`nx.json\`, \`.nvmrc\`, \`.oxfmtrc.json\`,
29	  \`.oxlintrc.json\`, and lockfile/configuration owned at the workspace root.
30	
31	Inside \`apps/desktop/\`:
32	
33	- \`build/\` - Electron packaging assets; avoid edits unless working on packaging/signing.
34	- \`drizzle/\` - Generated Drizzle SQL migrations and metadata.
35	- \`scripts/\` - Release, verification, and build support scripts.
36	- \`src/main/\` - Electron main process, RPC controllers, services, DB, ACP, PTY, and SSH.
37	- \`src/preload/\` - Typed Electron preload bridge exposed to the renderer.
38	- \`src/renderer/\` - React app organized around \`app/\`, \`features/\`, \`lib/\`, and tests.
39	- \`src/shared/\` - App IPC primitives, provider metadata, events, ACP, MCP, skills, and types.
40	- \`src/types/\` - Ambient and cross-cutting TypeScript declarations.
41	- \`tooling/\` - App-level development and test infrastructure not bundled into production.
42	
43	## Build & Development Commands
44	
45	Use Node \`24.14.0\` from \`.nvmrc\` and \`pnpm@10.28.2\`. Root scripts are powered by Nx
46	and run package targets in dependency order with local caching where configured.
47	
48	Install dependencies from the repo root:
49	
