          "text": "Here's a checklist for adding an optional \`foo: string\` field to \`AgentUpdate\`. No files edited.

## Plan: add optional \`foo?: string\` to \`AgentUpdate\`

**1. Decide scope of the field**
- [ ] Confirm which variants get \`foo\` — a single variant (e.g. \`message\`), a subset, or all of the union in \`packages/core/src/acp/agent-update.ts:43\`. Optional fields on a discriminated union must be added per-variant, not once, so this decision drives the rest.

**2. Amend the type**
- [ ] Add \`foo?: string;\` to the chosen variant(s) in the \`AgentUpdate\` union (\`agent-update.ts:43-93\`).
- [ ] Update the doc comment above the union / relevant variant to explain what \`foo\` means and when it's populated.

**3. Populate it in \`toAgentUpdate\`**
- [ ] In \`toAgentUpdate\` (\`agent-update.ts:122\`), set \`foo\` in the matching \`case\` block(s) — decoding it from the ACP \`SessionUpdate\` if it comes from the protocol, or leaving it unset if it's only populated later by provider \`enrich\`.
- [ ] If \`foo\` originates from vendor \`_meta\` (like \`parentToolCallId\`), leave it \`undefined\` in the baseline and note that \`IAcpBehavior.enrich\` promotes it.

**4. Provider enrichment (if applicable)**
- [ ] Check \`packages/core/src/agents/plugins/capabilities/acp.ts\` (the \`enrich\` hook, ~line 85) and any provider \`enrich\` implementations under \`packages/plugins/\` to populate \`foo\` if it's vendor-specific.

**5. Downstream consumers**
- [ ] \`packages/core/src/acp/session-machine.ts\` — \`foo\` flows through \`Updated\` events and \`update\` Effects unchanged (no code change needed, but verify no exhaustive destructuring drops it).
- [ ] Trace \`AgentUpdate\` consumers: \`src/renderer/features/tasks/acp/\` (maps updates into \`@gugu/session-chat-ui\`) and \`packages/chat-ui/\` renderer — decide whether \`foo\` needs rendering or just passthrough.
- [ ] Check \`SessionSnapshot\` / IPC serialization path (\`state.ts\`) — an optional string serializes fine, but confirm no schema/validation rejects unknown fields.

**6. Tests**
- [ ] Update/add cases in \`packages/core/src/acp/agent-update.test.ts\` covering \`foo\` set and unset.
- [ ] Check \`acp-session-runtime.test.ts\` and any chat-ui snapshot tests for fixtures that assert on full \`AgentUpdate\` shape.

**7. Verify**
- [ ] \`pnpm run typecheck\` (catches every exhaustive switch/spread that needs updating).
- [ ] \`pnpm run test\` (or focused \`@gugu/session-core\` + \`chat-ui\` targets).
- [ ] \`pnpm run lint\` / \`pnpm run format\`.

The two load-bearing spots are the union definition and \`toAgentUpdate\` (both in \`agent-update.ts\`); everything else is passthrough plus deciding whether the renderer should surface \`foo\`.",
        },
